{"version":1,"content":"<p>財政司副司長兼署理房屋局長黃偉綸、發展局長甯漢豪今早（30日）出席記者會時，各自為宏福苑火災對災民帶來悲痛和社會哀傷而致歉。</p><p>【相關報道：黃偉綸、甯漢豪致歉 甯漢豪稱曾「思考」問責但要按特首指示】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:43:45.087755+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:08:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.778657+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:38:54.960503+00:00","content_hash":"33daea08ca48c563eb1c8dd8ce3250daaec3bdc3087eba90c9a068d1d92281c4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}